# MCP Router

Canon: `AGENTS.md`.

Use only configured and available tools. Do not invent MCP servers, commands, schemas, or behavior.

Before any MCP call:

- Confirm the tool/resource exists in the active environment.
- Read available schema/metadata when needed.
- If missing or failing, state reason and use local files or standard verification.

Typical routing when configured:

- GitHub: PRs, issues, CI.
- Playwright/browser: UI verification.
- agent memory: explicit recall/remember workflows.
- context docs: current external library docs.
